## 材料与配液计算（注意：现有 UCUM 子集无 `%`，浓度以 mg/mL 等价表达）

```asterlab
kind: material
id: mat-lap-025
schema: 1
name: LAP 光引发剂溶液（0.25% w/v）
role: control
condition: 0.25% (w/v) 固定溶剂，用于配制各浓度 GelMA
concentration: {value: 2.5, unit: mg/mL}
source: lab_imported
```

```asterlab
kind: material
id: mat-gelma-3
schema: 1
name: 3% GelMA 水凝胶（0.25% LAP 溶剂）
role: treatment
condition: 3% (w/v)，按 4 孔余量配 2.0 mL（60 mg GelMA + 2.0 mL 0.25% LAP）
concentration: {value: 30, unit: mg/mL}
source: lab_imported
```

```asterlab
kind: material
id: mat-gelma-5
schema: 1
name: 5% GelMA 水凝胶（0.25% LAP 溶剂）
role: treatment
condition: 5% (w/v)，按 4 孔余量配 2.0 mL（100 mg GelMA + 2.0 mL 0.25% LAP）
concentration: {value: 50, unit: mg/mL}
source: lab_imported
```

```asterlab
kind: material
id: mat-gelma-7
schema: 1
name: 7% GelMA 水凝胶（0.25% LAP 溶剂）
role: treatment
condition: 7% (w/v)，按 4 孔余量配 2.0 mL（140 mg GelMA + 2.0 mL 0.25% LAP）
concentration: {value: 70, unit: mg/mL}
source: lab_imported
```

```asterlab
kind: material
id: mat-vegf
schema: 1
name: 重组人 VEGF（工作浓度 10 ng/mL）
role: treatment
condition: 接种时提前加入细胞悬液（2×10^5 cells/mL，DMEM 高糖 + 10% FBS）
concentration: {value: 10, unit: ng/mL}
source: lab_imported
```

```asterlab
kind: calculator
id: calc-vegf-dilution
schema: 1
title: VEGF 工作液稀释计算
mode: dilution
stock: {value: 10, unit: ug/mL}
target: {value: 10, unit: ng/mL}
final_volume: {value: 5, unit: mL}
```

