## 执行步骤与流程（`step@3` + `workflow@1`）

```asterlab
kind: step
id: step-01-sterilize
schema: 1
execution: executable
title: 01 GelMA 热冷循环消毒与脱泡
assay: assay-tube-formation
path: huvec/01-sterilize-degas
order: 1
uses:
  - {ref: ref-block-step-01-sterilize, role: other}
  - {ref: mat-gelma-3, role: material}
  - {ref: mat-gelma-5, role: material}
  - {ref: mat-gelma-7, role: material}
  - {ref: inst-waterbath-80, role: instrument}
  - {ref: inst-centrifuge, role: instrument}
tasks:
  - {id: cycle-1, title: "第1轮：80°C 水浴 5 min → 冰上 10 min", kind: procedure}
  - {id: cycle-2, title: "第2轮：80°C 水浴 5 min → 冰上 10 min", kind: procedure}
  - {id: cycle-3, title: "第3轮：80°C 水浴 5 min → 冰上 10 min", kind: procedure}
  - {id: degas, title: "2000 rpm 离心脱泡（无明显气泡可按方案跳过）", kind: procedure}
checks:
  - {checkId: chk-cycles, title: "3 轮 80°C(5min)/冰上(10min) 循环完成", blocking: true}
  - {checkId: chk-degas, title: "气泡状态确认（已离心或确认无气泡豁免）", blocking: true}
```

```asterlab
kind: step
id: step-02-coat-cure
schema: 1
execution: executable
title: 02 12孔板铺胶与 405nm 光固化
assay: assay-tube-formation
path: huvec/02-coat-cure
order: 2
uses:
  - {ref: ref-block-step-02-coat-cure, role: other}
  - {ref: plate-12w-main, role: labware}
  - {ref: inst-uv-405, role: instrument}
  - {ref: mat-gelma-3, role: material}
  - {ref: mat-gelma-5, role: material}
  - {ref: mat-gelma-7, role: material}
tasks:
  - {id: dispense, title: "按 A1-A3(3%)、B1-B3(5%)、C1-C3(7%) 铺胶 0.5 mL/孔并铺匀", kind: procedure}
  - {id: cure, title: "405 nm 紫外照射至完全固化（参考 120 s，记录实际秒数）", kind: procedure}
checks:
  - {checkId: chk-even, title: "各孔铺胶均匀、无大面积缺胶或气泡", blocking: true}
  - {checkId: chk-cured, title: "405 nm 完全固化并记录实际照射时长", blocking: true}
```

```asterlab
kind: step
id: step-03-soak
schema: 1
execution: executable
title: 03 完全培养基 4°C 浸泡平衡
assay: assay-tube-formation
path: huvec/03-soak
order: 3
uses:
  - {ref: ref-block-step-03-soak, role: other}
  - {ref: plate-12w-main, role: labware}
tasks:
  - {id: add-medium, title: "每孔加入 1.0 mL 完全培养基（DMEM 高糖 + 10% FBS，共 9 mL）", kind: procedure}
  - {id: incubate-4c, title: "4°C 冰箱浸泡 ≥ 2 h，确保培养基完全浸没水凝胶", kind: procedure}
checks:
  - {checkId: chk-submerged, title: "水凝胶完全浸没且 4°C 浸泡时间 ≥ 2 h", blocking: true}
```

```asterlab
kind: step
id: step-04-seed
schema: 1
execution: executable
title: 04 复温与接种 HUVEC（建立 t0 锚点）
assay: assay-tube-formation
path: huvec/04-seed
order: 4
uses:
  - {ref: ref-block-step-04-seed, role: other}
  - {ref: plate-12w-main, role: labware}
  - {ref: mat-vegf, role: material}
  - {ref: calc-vegf-dilution, role: calculator}
  - {ref: s-w01, role: sample}
  - {ref: s-w02, role: sample}
  - {ref: s-w03, role: sample}
  - {ref: s-w04, role: sample}
  - {ref: s-w05, role: sample}
  - {ref: s-w06, role: sample}
  - {ref: s-w07, role: sample}
  - {ref: s-w08, role: sample}
  - {ref: s-w09, role: sample}
tasks:
  - {id: rewarm, title: "孔板复温并吸去浸泡培养基", kind: procedure}
  - {id: prep-cells, title: "配制 2×10^5/mL HUVEC 悬液 + 10 ng/mL VEGF（配制 5.0 mL 余量）", kind: procedure}
  - {id: seed, title: "每孔接种 0.5 mL（1×10^5 cells/孔），放回培养箱并记录 t0", kind: procedure}
checks:
  - {checkId: chk-vegf, title: "细胞悬液已提前添加 10 ng/mL VEGF 并混匀", blocking: true}
  - {checkId: chk-t0, title: "接种完成放回培养箱时刻 (t0) 已记录", blocking: true}
```

